    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、忙しい、忙しい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, we're so busy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん？はい！
ご注文ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? Oh, hello! Are
you ready to order?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、いや、わたしたちは
そうじゃなくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, um, no! We're not here to eat...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ということは……
バイトォォォォォー！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Wait, you mean...
You're looking for work!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やたー！
これで人手不足は解消よ！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh wow! We'll finally have enough staff!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん！即、採用ッ！
店長にはあたしが話しておくわ。
じゃあ早速行きましょうか！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay! You're hired! I'll tell the
owner, so let's get you started!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？
あ、あの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? Umm, that's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……な、なんか
これと同じような展開を
見たことがあるような……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I kinda feel like I've seen
this somewhere before...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>う、うん……
そうかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It does seem familiar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だ、ダメだわ……
やっぱり忙しすぎる！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No, no, we're way too busy for this!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お願い！　バイト代は払うから、
もう一度だけ手伝って！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Please! I promise we'll pay
you, so...just one more time!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人の話、まったく聞いてねぇし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She doesn't listen very well, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもまあ、困った人を助けるなら
いいかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, well...if we can help someone
in need, isn't that good enough?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ホント？助かるわ。
じゃああの右奥にいる
三つ子のお客様の注文とって来て</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really!? Great! Then, can you cover the
back right table? There are three girls there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>終ったらアタシのところに戻って、
その注文を教えてね？
じゃあよろしくっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once you're done, just come back to me
and tell me what they ordered! Thanks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それだけか？
そんくらいなら何でもねーじゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's all? Alright, we
can do that in no time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とりあえず
すぐ行ってこよう？
右奥の、三つ子、だよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, so let's go. It's the
three girls at the back right.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ホント？助かるわ。
じゃああの右奥にいる
三つ子のお客様の注文とって来て</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really!? Great! Then, can you cover the
back right table? There are three girls there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>終ったらアタシのところに戻って、
その注文を教えてね？
じゃあよろしくっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once you're done, just come back to me
and tell me what they ordered! Thanks!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274888</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よ、よ～し、
今度こそ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, I think I'm ready.
I'll get it right this time!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……がんばれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Good luck.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わりーけど、おれたち
バイトじゃないんだ。ごめんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, sorry, but we're
not looking for work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えぇ～
そそそ、そんなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really?
Oh, no...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
